<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Patagonia started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Patagonia started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings analyst Tadd Chessen started coverage of Argentine food retailer Sociedad Anonima Importadora y Exportadora de la Patagonia Tuesday with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The stock has shown considerable returns over the last 18 months, but ... there is still room for upside, despite the stock's low liquidity,&quot; ING Barings wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- He set a June 1998 target price equivalent to $17.80 a share, a 22 percent increase above current levels.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares closed Monday at 14.90 pesos in Buenos Aires.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
